{
  "vector_format": 1,
  "suite": "scoring",
  "description": "(question, response) -> expected result under the versioned scoring rules true-false-v1, numeric-v1 and short-text-v1. Every question here is valid. expect.status is 'scored' (score is the integer 0 or 1) or 'invalid_response' (nothing is scored; code says why). For short_text, expect.normalised_response is the response after normalisation. This file is written with ASCII-only JSON escapes so that invisible characters (U+00A0, U+2009, U+202F, U+2212, combining marks) are unambiguous.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "tf-true-correct",
      "kind": "true_false",
      "response_spec": {},
      "answer_key": {
        "scoring_version": "true-false-v1",
        "correct": true
      },
      "response": {
        "value": true
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": "scored",
        "scoring_version": "true-false-v1",
        "score": 1,
        "is_correct": true
      }
    },
